   C(2, "The tricks that pass them", "In the Dark House, they pass the night by fooling the lords — their own trick of putting substitutes for the required candles and macaw-feathers keeps them alive till dawn.", ["ordeals"], "obj.ord.houses"),
   C(3, "The House of Bats", "In the House of Bats, Hunahpu sticks his head out to watch for dawn — and the great bat Camazotz snips it off: the most famous moment of the ordeals.", ["ordeals"], "obj.ord.bats"),
   C(4, "The head in the ballcourt", "The lords hang his head on the ballcourt — but the twins trick it back: a squash on the shoulders while the real head is rescued, and the game goes on.", ["ordeals"], "obj.ord.bats"),
